    src: "WSET, Understanding acidity in wine (2026) ; van Leeuwen et Destrac-Irvine, Modified grape composition under climate change conditions requires adaptations in the vineyard, OENO One (2017) ; Yamane et al., Effects of temperature on anthocyanin biosynthesis in grape berry skins, AJEV 57(1), 2006 (résumé UC Davis) ; Wine Folly, Warm climate vs cool climate wines ; Wine Folly, What are cool climate wines? ; JancisRobinson.com, Pinot Noir ; D’après École du Vin de France, Le Grand Cours de dégustation (Hachette), p. 30-35 ; cf. Mille Vignes, P. Lepeltier, p. 278 ; Oxford Companion to Wine, 5e éd. (2023) ; WSET, « Understanding acidity in wine » (2026)",
